Voidwalkers are often chosen by Warlocks in classic WoW for leveling and questing because of their superior tanking capabilities. The Voidwalker's Torment ability provides strong threat generation, allowing it to effectively tank enemies. Additionally, the Consume Shadows ability helps the Voidwalker regenerate health out of combat, making it more durable. While the Succubus has useful abilities like Seduction and Soothing Kiss, its lower tanking potential makes it less ideal for solo play and questing. [end of text]


